  "body": "Update `assets/posts/haas.cps` to fix core Haas Next Generation Control (NGC) safety and dialect gaps.\n\nImplement these changes:\n- Fix program-end and `home` retract sequences (`onClose()` and `afterOp()`). Restore `G90` after any `G91 G28` move, or emit `G53 G0 Z0` and `G53 Y0` when safe retract applies. Do not leave `G91` modal before `M30` (see `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/haas/*.nc`). Document the retract choice in `docs/decisions/`.\n- Add `G94` to `startPreamble()` (`G17 G90 G94 <wcsWord> G40 G49 G80`).\n- Declare `millSpindleReverse = true;` (`crates/post/src/post/engine.rs:229-235`) and emit `M4` when `MillSpindle == \"reverse\"` (`fanuc.cps:21`).\n- Declare `explains = \"paren\";` and support `explain(words)` (`crates/post/src/post/explain.rs:1-20`).\n- Add `G74` left-hand tapping in `onCycle()` (`assets/posts/haas.cps:585-625`) alongside `G84`.\n- Emit `M89` when Through-Spindle Coolant (`M88`) stops (`doosan-dnm.cps` pattern). Emit `M74` or `M84` when air blast (`M73` or `M83`) stops. Keep `M9` for `M8` flood and `M7` mist.\n- Add or update golden tests under `crates/post/` and `crates/app/tests/golden/nc/haas/`.\n\nDone means: `haas.cps` posts NGC-safe start and end blocks without leaving `G91` active at `M30`, and tests pass for `M89`, air blast off, `M4`, `G74`, and `Explain`.\n\nPart of #1961\n",
